{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:388c9225a0d44757","name":"Reborn","source":{"id":"source:reference-388c9225a0d44757","title":"Reborn","revision":19004,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:07:26Z","sha256":"6c45406e268a658fb92529ba7aaa6c4da58004c5b9affc7d887d114361ba80dc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19004","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Reborn&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-388c9225a0d44757","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Disciples of Ragnos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Disciples_of_Ragnos","referenceId":"reference:a971b744a191ec6a"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," is the achievement of the dream of artificially imbuing the ability to perceive and manipulate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," into beings that didn't have it before. Working as Dark Jedi warriors, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," serve as the foot soldiers of the faction known as the Empire Reborn, dedicated to returning the ideals of Emperor Palpatine back to the galaxy at large. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," originated with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Desann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Desann","referenceId":"reference:8fbb3d0540503e25"},", one of Luke Skywalker's former students at the Jedi Praxeum who fell to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hethrir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hethrir","referenceId":"reference:24f63e599ba7eb8f"},", a former apprentice to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"}," and servant of the Emperor. By deceiving ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kyle Karan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kyle_Karan?action=edit&redlink=1"}," into giving away the location of the Valley of the Jedi and the Force Nexus located there, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hethrir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hethrir","referenceId":"reference:24f63e599ba7eb8f"}," increased his powers fourfold by absorbing energy from ancient Jedi and Sith spirits. After gaining that power, the two Dark Jedi were able to imbue others with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," and use them as warriors to threaten ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," and Skywalker's New Jedi Order.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Dispatched by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Desann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Desann","referenceId":"reference:8fbb3d0540503e25"}," and the Empire Reborn, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," worked in conjunction with units of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," to perform various missions across the galaxy. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Desann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Desann","referenceId":"reference:8fbb3d0540503e25"}," used these missions not only to further the cause of the Empire Reborn but also to help train ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Reborn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Reborn","referenceId":"reference:e5c5d6c6c0f495f1"}," for Desann's ultimate goal: the death of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"}," and the destruction of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". They were stopped by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kyle Katarn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kyle_Katarn","referenceId":"reference:71f9e86450d44ffa"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rogue Squadron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rogue_Squadron","referenceId":"reference:e6e2c9567a6f5c6f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Those Reborn who survived the assault assembled under the leadership of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tavion Axmis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tavion_Axmis?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Desann's apprentice. With the assistance of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", Tavion created a Sith cult called ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Disciples of Ragnos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Disciples_of_Ragnos","referenceId":"reference:a971b744a191ec6a"}," and named it the New Reborn. Striving to continue Desann's work, the cultists eventually made their way to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Korriban"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Korriban","referenceId":"reference:e5de27f696051005"},", where they were defeated within the ancient Sith tombs in the Valley of the Dark Lords by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jaden Korr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jaden_Korr?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and a band of Jedi from Skywalker's academy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Reborn are easily recognized by their orange cloaks and simple, red-bladed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". Even though they have been granted the ability to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", their aptitude to wield it is not very strong, but their ability with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," compensates for this shortcoming.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The Reborn Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","chi